### Enterprise RAG System — HTTP API Requests Collection
### Can be executed using VS Code REST Client or IntelliJ HTTP Client.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@tenantSlug = acme

### ============================================================================
### 1. HEALTH AND READINESS PROBES
### ============================================================================

### 1.1 Immediate Liveness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Downstream Readiness Probe (DB & AI Providers)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION & TOKENS
### ============================================================================

### 2.1 Authenticate as Admin (Clearance: RESTRICTED 40)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@acme.corp",
  "password": "AcmeDemo2026!",
  "tenant_slug": "{{tenantSlug}}"
}

### Store token from response
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### 2.2 Authenticate as HR Specialist (Clearance: INTERNAL 20, Dept: HR)
# @name loginHR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hr.specialist@acme.corp",
  "password": "AcmeDemo2026!",
  "tenant_slug": "{{tenantSlug}}"
}

@hrToken = {{loginHR.response.body.access_token}}

### 2.3 Authenticate as IT Security Analyst (Clearance: INTERNAL 20, Dept: IT)
# @name loginIT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sec.analyst@acme.corp",
  "password": "AcmeDemo2026!",
  "tenant_slug": "{{tenantSlug}}"
}

@itToken = {{loginIT.response.body.access_token}}

### 2.4 Verify Caller Identity & Claims
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================================
### 3. DOCUMENT MANAGEMENT
### ============================================================================

### 3.1 List Authorized Documents (Admin sees all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 List Authorized Documents (IT Analyst sees only IT and General docs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{itToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.3 Upload New Document (Admin/Authorized department)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{itToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

--WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

ACME Corporation — Internal Network Topology
--WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="department"

it
--WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="access_level"

20
--WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="network_topology.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

# Internal Network Topology
All corporate VPC subnets route through the central Transit Gateway in eu-central-1.
--WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--


### ============================================================================
### 4. HYBRID KNOWLEDGE RETRIEVAL
### ============================================================================

### 4.1 Hybrid Search: Leave Policy Rollover
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/retrieval/search
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "How many days of paid time off can be rolled over?",
  "department": "hr",
  "top_k": 3
}

### 4.2 Hybrid Search: Disaster Recovery Standby
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/retrieval/search
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What is the secondary standby AWS region for disaster recovery?",
  "top_k": 3
}


### ============================================================================
### 5. GROUNDED RAG QUESTION ANSWERING
### ============================================================================

### 5.1 Answerable Question with Source Citations
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rag/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the maximum number of unused PTO days an employee can carry over into the next year?",
  "department": "hr",
  "top_k": 5
}

### 5.2 Department Clearance Ceiling (HR Specialist asking about IT DR runbook)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rag/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the RTO time objective for the Frankfurt database failover?",
  "department": "it",
  "top_k": 5
}

### 5.3 Honest Abstention (Query on Unanswerable Subject)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rag/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the quantum encryption protocol planned for Martian satellites?",
  "top_k": 5
}


### ============================================================================
### 6. ADMINISTRATION & RBAC
### ============================================================================

### 6.1 List Active Tenants (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6.2 Provision New Tenant (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ACME Logistics Partner",
  "slug": "acme-logistics"
}

### 6.3 List Users in Tenant (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6.4 Forbidden Non-Admin Call (HR Specialist attempting admin action)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Accept: application/json
